    what have you brought back? You don\u2019t even know this?","_text_jp":"\u30b0\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u3001\u3053\u308c\u306f\u4f55\u3092\u9023\u308c\u3066\u304d\u305f\u3093\u3060\uff1f\u3053\u3093\u306a\u3053\u3068\u3082\u77e5\u3089\u306a\u3044\u306e\u304b\uff1f"},"_actorName":"\u8001\u677f\u5a18","_actorParameterID":"ad90f055-cf7e-4ce6-9cd7-df63956fb206","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":940.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"11"},{"FaceType":{"_value":25},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u554a\u54c8\u54c8\u54c8\u3002\u3002\u3002\u3002\u96c5\u5c14\u5979\u662f\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5e97\u7684\u5e97\u957f\uff0c\u827e\u7c73\u4e3d\u65af\u3002","_text_en":"Ahahaha...
    Yar, she\u2019s the shopkeeper here, Amyris.","_text_jp":"\u3042\u306f\u306f\u2026\u30e4\u30fc\u30eb\u3001\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u3053\u306e\u5e97\u306e\u5e97\u9577\u3001\u30a8\u30a4\u30df\u30ea\u30b9\u3060\u3088\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u53e4\u838e","_actorParameterID":"73b7f0b8-ed21-4a53-874d-a13e4eb34686","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":1060.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"12"},{"FaceType":{},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{"_value":true},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{"_value":3},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u8fd9\u91cc\u662f\u9053\u5177\u5c4b\uff0c\u552e\u5356\u8dcc\u6253\u635f\u4f24\u836f\u548c\u7cbe\u529b\u8865\u5145\u5242\u3002","_text_en":"This
    is a general goods shop. We sell medicines for injuries and energy supplements.","_text_jp":"\u3053\u3053\u306f\u9053\u5177\u5c4b\u3060\u3088\u3001\u6253\u64b2\u85ac\u3084\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u88dc\u5145\u5264\u3092\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u308b\u3093\u3060\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u8001\u677f\u5a18","_actorParameterID":"ad90f055-cf7e-4ce6-9cd7-df63956fb206","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":1180.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"13"},{"FaceType":{"_value":22},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u539f\u6765\u662f\u8fd9\u6837\u3002","_text_en":"I
    see.","_text_jp":"\u306a\u308b\u307b\u3069\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u96c5\u5c14","_actorParameterID":"71cf2094-e4cc-42f8-b1a0-57d79ea03454","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":1300.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"14"},{"FaceType":{},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{"_value":true},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{"_value":3},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u5509\u5440\uff0c\u53e4\u838e\uff0c\u4f60\u5e26\u56de\u6765\u4e00\u4e2a\u9ebb\u70e6\u5462\u3002","_text_en":"Oh,
    Gusha, you\u2019ve brought me a troublemaker.","_text_jp":"\u3042\u3089\u3042\u3089\u3001\u30b0\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u3001\u9762\u5012\u306a\u3082\u306e\u3092\u9023\u308c\u3066\u304d\u305f\u306d\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u8001\u677f\u5a18","_actorParameterID":"ad90f055-cf7e-4ce6-9cd7-df63956fb206","_position":{"x":201.0,"y":1420.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"15"},{"FaceType":{},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{"_value":true},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{"_value":3},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u770b\u6837\u5b50\u662f\u4e2a\u54ea\u5bb6\u51fa\u6765\u7684\u5927\u5c0f\u59d0\uff0c\u4e0d\u61c2\u4eba\u60c5\u4e16\u6545\u5462\u3002","_text_en":"Looks
    like she\u2019s some rich young lady, doesn\u2019t understand the ways of the
    world.","_text_jp":"\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3089\u304a\u5b22\u69d8\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u4eba\u60c5\u304c\u308f\u304b\u3063\u3066\u306a\u3044\u307f\u305f\u3044\u3060\u306d\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u8001\u677f\u5a18","_actorParameterID":"ad90f055-cf7e-4ce6-9cd7-df63956fb206","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":1540.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"16"},{"FaceType":{"_value":2},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u5979\u6551\u4e86\u6211\uff0c\u4e3d\u65af\u4e0d\u8981\u8fd9\u4e48\u8bf4\u5979\u3002","_text_en":"She
    saved me, Amyris, don\u2019t talk like that.","_text_jp":"\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u79c1\u3092\u52a9\u3051\u3066\u304f\u308c\u305f\u3093\u3060\u3001\u30ea\u30b9\u3001\u305d\u3093\u306a\u98a8\u306b\u8a00\u308f\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u53e4\u838e","_actorParameterID":"73b7f0b8-ed21-4a53-874d-a13e4eb34686","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":1660.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"17"},{"FaceType":{"_value":2},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u4f60\u8981\u662f\u518d\u591a\u5634\u6211\u53ef\u8981\u751f\u6c14\u4e86\u3002","_text_en":"If
    you keep talking, I\u2019ll get angry.","_text_jp":"\u3082\u3057\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306b\u8a00\u3044\u305f\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u3063\u305f\u3089\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u6012\u308b\u304b\u3089\u306d\u3002"},"_actorName":"\u53e4\u838e","_actorParameterID":"73b7f0b8-ed21-4a53-874d-a13e4eb34686","_position":{"x":200.0,"y":1780.0},"$type":"Game.GameRuntime.Story.NodeCanvasExtend.StatementNodeEx","$id":"18"},{"FaceType":{},"UseShopkeeperPortrait":{"_value":true},"ShopBody":{},"ShopFace":{"_value":1},"UseChiefPortrait":{},"ChiefFace":{},"statement":{"_text":"\u597d\u5427\u597d\u5427~\u81f3\u5c11\u5728\u8fd9\u91cc\u751f\u6d3b\u4e5f\u7b97\u7ed9\u6211\u6dfb\u4e86\u4e2a\u987e\u5ba2\uff0c\u5927\u5c0f\u59d0~\u80af\u5b9a\u5f88\u6709\u94b1\u5427~~","_text_en":"Fine,
    fine~ At least having you here as a customer is a good thing for me, young lady~
